        <mxCell id="p0_36" value="1. Master Role Boundaries: CLUB_MANAGER is the executive administrator overseeing facilities, finances, personnel and race confirmation.&#10;2. Operational Modularity: Every workflow (01 through 10) maps to dedicated Spring Boot REST Controllers, JPA Entities, and Database Trigger Guards.&#10;3. End-to-End Traceability: State-changing operations across all phases trigger automatic append-only logging in dbo.audit_logs." style="text;html=0;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1025" width="1780" height="85" as="geometry" />
