        <mxCell id="p2_34" value="BUSINESS RULES &amp; TECHNICAL CONSTRAINTS: RBAC ARCHITECTURE &amp; IMMUTABLE ROLES" style="text;html=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2563EB;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1000" width="1780" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_35" value="1. Five Fixed System Roles: CLUB_MANAGER, HEAD_TRAINER, STABLE_STAFF, HORSE_OWNER, VETERINARIAN.&#10;2. Immutability of CLUB_MANAGER: Club Manager authorities cannot be toggled off to prevent system lockout.&#10;3. Historical Accountability Lock: Once a user account has participated in veterinary cases, horse ownership or training logs, its role cannot be changed to prevent data corruption." style="text;html=0;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1025" width="1780" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
