        <mxCell id="p4_35" value="BUSINESS RULES &amp; TECHNICAL CONSTRAINTS: INTAKE GATES &amp; HARD CLINICAL ENFORCEMENT" style="text;html=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2563EB;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1000" width="1780" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_36" value="1. Clinical Examination Invariant: Monthly health checkups and regular schedules cannot be created without a genuine clinical exam record.&#10;2. Injured Horses: Horses with active injuries or locks are still stabled for shelter, but strictly prohibited from appearing in trainer intake.&#10;3. Trainer Acceptance Criteria: intake_status == 'STABLED', health_status == 'FIT', diagnosing_vet_user_id IS NOT NULL, and no active locks in dbo.training_locks." style="text;html=0;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1025" width="1780" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
