        <mxCell id="p5_32" value="BUSINESS RULES &amp; TECHNICAL CONSTRAINTS: DATABASE TRIGGER GUARD: TR_STALL_ASSIGNMENT_UNIQUE_ACTIVE" style="text;html=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#D97706;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1000" width="1780" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5_33" value="1. Stall Exclusivity: Prevents two active assignments for the same stall_id simultaneously.&#10;2. Horse Exclusivity: Prevents a single horse from holding multiple active stall assignments.&#10;3. Stable Capacity Limit: Enforces a maximum of 4 active horses per stable building unit at all times.&#10;4. Unassignment Effect: Releasing a stall resets current_trainer_id to NULL and transitions intake_status back to PENDING_STALL." style="text;html=0;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1025" width="1780" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
