        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p7_30" value="1. Atomic Consistency: Inventory subtraction and expense booking occur inside a single Spring database transaction; if either fails, both revert.&#10;2. Target Entity Rules: Medical supplies must link to a specific horse; facility items (straw, sawdust) link to a stable unit.&#10;3. Real Money vs Expense: This record logs operational consumption cost in VND; it does not automatically debit external bank accounts." style="text;html=0;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1025" width="1780" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
