        <mxCell id="p8_36" value="BUSINESS RULES &amp; TECHNICAL CONSTRAINTS: DATABASE TRIGGER GUARD: TR_RACE_REGISTRATION_STATUS_GUARD" style="text;html=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#D97706;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1000" width="1780" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_37" value="1. Tripartite Consent Rule: Trainer initiates (SUBMITTED) -&gt; Owner authorizes (APPROVE) -&gt; Club Manager confirms (CONFIRMED).&#10;2. State Progression: Direct transition from SUBMITTED to CONFIRMED by manager is strictly rejected by Trigger 53001.&#10;3. Irrevocability: Once an entry is CONFIRMED, it cannot be withdrawn without formal steward intervention; no edits after race completion." style="text;html=0;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1025" width="1780" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
