        <mxCell id="p9_31" value="BUSINESS RULES &amp; TECHNICAL CONSTRAINTS: FINANCIAL ACCOUNTING PRINCIPLES &amp; ANTI-DUPLICATION" style="text;html=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2563EB;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1000" width="1780" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p9_32" value="1. Append-Only General Ledger: The financial_transactions table is strictly additive. Adjustments are logged as reversing or compensating entries.&#10;2. Double-Count Prevention: Automated transactions (PayOS webhook wallet top-ups, stock usage deductions) automatically generate ledger entries and must not be re-entered.&#10;3. Currency Standardization: All ledger entries are recorded in Vietnamese Dong (VND) without fractional currency units." style="text;html=0;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1025" width="1780" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
