        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p10_33" value="1. Tamper-Proof Legal Protection: Database trigger tr_audit_logs_append_only blocks all UPDATE and DELETE operations unconditionally (Error 50001).&#10;2. State Reconstruction: Serialized JSON snapshots preserve old_values_json and new_values_json, enabling exact state diff reconstruction at any point in history.&#10;3. Investigation Scope: Audit log inspection is a verification and compliance tool; it does not substitute for active operational approval steps." style="text;html=0;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1025" width="1780" height="85" as="geometry" />
